{"parse": {"title": "床下怪物", "pageid": 2188, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"床下怪物\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/20/Item-110104.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"床下怪物\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>床下怪物</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#110104</div></div><hr /><div>怪物……怪物！妈妈，帮帮我！我的床底下有一只怪物！用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">孩子们说的都是真的。每一对父母都要注意这些怪物，它们有可能是拐走孩子的恶棍，也可能是一笔丰厚的家用补贴。如有意出售你捕捉到的床下怪物，请致电098-1937**21。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">荒原合成</td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">迷途鉴定</td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-stage\">7TH-26</td><td class=\"source-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-26\" title=\"7TH-26\">银镜与纱幕</a><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #8c4646; padding: 0 5px;\">厄险</span><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">极小概率\n</span></td></tr></tbody></table><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">配方</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110103\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%95%AE%E5%92%AC%E7%9B%92\" title=\"啮咬盒\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%95%AE%E5%92%AC%E7%9B%92\" title=\"啮咬盒\"><img alt=\"啮咬盒\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Item-110103.png/100px-Item-110103.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Item-110103.png/150px-Item-110103.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Item-110103.png/200px-Item-110103.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%95%AE%E5%92%AC%E7%9B%92\" title=\"啮咬盒\">啮咬盒</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">古怪的盒子。沉甸甸的，偶有怪声传出。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×3</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110403\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9D%E5%9C%A3%E7%A7%98%E9%93%B6\" title=\"祝圣秘银\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9D%E5%9C%A3%E7%A7%98%E9%93%B6\" title=\"祝圣秘银\"><img alt=\"祝圣秘银\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Item-110403.png/100px-Item-110403.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Item-110403.png/150px-Item-110403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Item-110403.png/200px-Item-110403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9D%E5%9C%A3%E7%A7%98%E9%93%B6\" title=\"祝圣秘银\">祝圣秘银</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">闪闪发光的银锭，祝圣仪式让它光可鉴人。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110503\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BE%E7%81%B5%E7%99%BE%E9%AA%8C%E9%B8%9F\" title=\"百灵百验鸟\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-li