em-203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/CurrencyItem-203.png/200px-CurrencyItem-203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%A9%E9%BD%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%84%BF\" title=\"利齿子儿\">利齿子儿</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">神秘学家的货币。各方各面都有所需。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×500</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "床下怪物"}}